{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذَا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "قِيلَ", "translation": "it is said"}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(Do) not"}, {"text": "تُفْسِدُوا۟", "translation": "spread corruption"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "translation": "the earth"}, {"text": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translation": "they say"}, {"text": "إِنَّمَا", "translation": "Only"}, {"text": "نَحْنُ", "translation": "we"}, {"text": "مُصْلِحُونَ", "translation": "(are) reformers"}], "sahih": "And when it is said to them, \"Do not cause corruption on the earth,\" they say, \"We are but reformers.\""}